==Strategy==
The Zombies here are at a very low magnification, so you don't have to worry about them too much. From the get-go, start midrangers and backliners that outrange Lord Gravey; units like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] and/or [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter Cat]] will be instrumental in surviving the Aku Gory and Aku Doge horde. The pushing power of all the Akus combined with Lord Gravey necessitates tanky meatshields like [[Ancient Egg: N205 (Special Cat)|Bride Cat]] or [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] + [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]]. Notably, if you own [[The Invisible Cat (Special Cat)|Groom Cat]], he's great at catching unburrowing Zrocos and Zoges to make sure they don't revive later on.

